
# --- Contributor Quest commit helpers (all optional) ---
# Everything below this line is a comment and gets discarded from the commit message
# unless you uncomment it (delete the leading '#'). Lines left commented out are never
# seen by Contributor Quest — only what you uncomment becomes part of your real commit.
#
# Closing an issue? GitHub closes it automatically once this merges to main:
# Closes #
#
# Uncomment any that apply to THIS commit:
# [x] Added a new feature
# [x] Added a new module
# [x] Fixed a bug
# [x] Improved documentation
# [x] Refactored old code
#
# Don't want this specific commit counted at all (no XP, no guild credit, no badges,
# won't affect your leaderboard entry)? Uncomment this:
# [x] Don't include this commit in Contributor Quest stats
